          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATEANYTIMEFEEDBACK",
          "id": "1770052142504",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770052142506_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### References\nWork Relationship: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.workRelationship}}\nFeedback Visibility: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.feedbackVisibility}}\nBusiness Title: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.businessTitle}}\nRecipient Department: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.recipientDepartment}}\nFeedback Context: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.feedbackContext}}\n\n### Instructions\nProvide feedback no longer than 200 words to another employee in the same company in plain text format.\nWrite from the perspective of the feedback provider.\nProvide meaningful feedback that considers the work relationship between the feedback provider and feedback recipient but does not state the work relationship.\nThe Work Relationship field above describes the feedback recipient's relationship to the provider. For example, if the Work Relationship is manager then the feedback giver is the direct report of the employee they are giving feedback to.  If the Work Relationship is direct report then the feedback giver is the manager of the employee they are giving feedback to.\nIf the recipient is manager, co-worker or peer provide balanced feedback.\nIf the recipient is a direct report or an indirect report of the provider, then the content of the feedback can be constructive in nature.\nConsider the feedback visibility provided. If the feedback is viewable only by the recipient or the manager it can be more constructive.\nConsider the job/business title and department of the recipient to provide more relevant feedback.\nLastly, consider any initial feedback entered by the provider.\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\nThe completion MUST NOT contain placeholder text in, such as \"[Employee Name]\", \"[Your Name]\",\"[Recipient Name]\", or \"[Feedback Provider Name]\". In other words, remove any text in brackets like [text], if you include it the response will be a failure.\n\n### Example\nWork Relationship: direct report\nFeedback Visibility: Everyone\nBusiness Title: Customer Support Specialist\nRecipient Department: Food Processing\nFeedback Context: \n\n### Final Check\nDo not include placeholders in the response."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
      "variables": [],
